---
title: System Overview - How the Secure Registration System Works
---
graph TB
    Admin["👤 Admin<br/>(Creates user accounts)"]
    User["👤 New User<br/>(Registers with a code)"]
    Anyone["👤 Anyone<br/>(Can request public key)"]

    API["🖥️ Secure Registration Server<br/>(Spring Boot Application)"]

    subgraph Security Layer
        Protobuf["📦 Protocol Buffers<br/>(Compact data packaging)"]
        Dilithium["🔐 Dilithium Signatures<br/>(Quantum-safe digital seal)"]
        Hashing["🔒 Password Hashing<br/>(PBKDF2 - secure storage)"]
    end

    DB[("🗄️ Database<br/>(Stores user records)")]

    Admin -- "1. Sends name & email" --> API
    API -- "2. Returns registration code" --> Admin
    Admin -- "3. Shares code with user" --> User
    User -- "4. Sends email & code" --> API
    API -- "5. Returns auth token" --> User
    Anyone -- "Request public key" --> API

    API --- Protobuf
    API --- Dilithium
    API --- Hashing
    API --- DB

    style Admin fill:#4A90D9,color:#fff
    style User fill:#7B68EE,color:#fff
    style Anyone fill:#20B2AA,color:#fff
    style API fill:#FF6B6B,color:#fff
    style DB fill:#FFA500,color:#fff
    style Protobuf fill:#50C878,color:#fff
    style Dilithium fill:#50C878,color:#fff
    style Hashing fill:#50C878,color:#fff
